{"unit_id":"Francesco502__dsh-quota#card-zh","repo":"Francesco502/dsh-quota","commit":"79c33ba587103dfda4a07765bcfad926043798de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quota 是面向 DSH Web 的 AI 服务额度与用量监控插件。它在侧边栏提供额度面板，并通过本机服务路由获取各 Provider 的账户数据。面板聚合多家模型与编程服务的额度、余额和状态，支持连接测试、历史趋势、消耗速率估算、阈值告警及悬浮 HUD；Agent 也可调用 get_quota_status 查询汇总。适合需要集中掌握多个 AI 账户可用额度的 DSH 用户。按配置读取各服务 API Key 或本地账户授权，并向对应服务请求用量信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:18-40","src/client/index.ts:17-30","src/core/manager.ts:601-666"]}
{"unit_id":"Francesco502__dsh-quota#card-en","repo":"Francesco502/dsh-quota","commit":"79c33ba587103dfda4a07765bcfad926043798de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-quota monitors AI quota and usage in DSH Web. Its sidebar panel shows provider balances, status, history, alerts, and a floating HUD. DSH agents can query summaries with get_quota_status. It suits users tracking several AI accounts and may require provider API keys or account authorization.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:18-40","src/client/index.ts:17-30","src/core/manager.ts:601-666"]}
